> >Another example, how would I say "If I had a million dollars, I'd
> >be rich." in Lojban?
> >
> >I can say:
> >
> >ganai mi ponse le megdo be le rupnu gi mi ricfu
> >
> >which I would translate as:
> >
> >If I have a million dollars then I am rich.
